# 06 — Two tanks: coupling stocks into a chain.
# The outflow of one stock is the inflow of the next. Chaining stocks like this
# is how you build cascades, pipelines, and supply lines. Watch one drain as
# the other fills, conserving the total.
stock Upper [liters] = 100
stock Lower [liters] = 0

param k = 0.3       # transfer fraction per minute

flow transfer = k * Upper        # drains Upper, fills Lower

change(Upper) = -transfer
change(Lower) =  transfer

sim dt=0.1 to=25 method=rk4
plot Upper, Lower
